---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How GTA Cheat Codes handles data: there are no accounts, and saved cheats and trainer scores stay in your own browser storage."
>
  <article class="wrap page">
    <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="display">Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This site has no accounts and no sign-up. The interactive tools keep a few things in your browser's local storage so they work next time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Cheats you save with the star button.</li>
        <li>Combo Trainer personal bests and streaks.</li>
        <li>Your Cheat Roulette spin count, and the "wanted level" stars, which count pages viewed this session.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This data never leaves your device. Clear your browser's site data to remove it.</p>
      <p>
        Fonts load from Google Fonts, which receives standard request information such as your IP address. If analytics
        or advertising are added later, this page will be updated first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 48px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px);
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
</style>
